[TITLE]
SIM-03: a 10 hp constant-power pump lifts 1 cfs (448.831 gpm) from R1 (head 0) to J1
Correct head gain: 550 P / (62.4 Q) = 8.814 x 10 / 1 = 88.14 ft (26.87 m)

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     448.831   ; gpm = 1 cfs

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   0

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R1  J1  POWER 10    ; hp, because the units are US

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
